{
  "version": "0.7.2-beta.6",
  "notes": "## Changes since `v0.7.2-beta.5`\n\n### Features\n\n- open every argument after -- as a directory, so tterm -- -project opens a folder whose name starts with a dash: arguments starting with - were always skipped as options ([194280f0](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/194280f0bceb0b7c2a64da462ace6c1345bcda87))\n- add the tterm command when tTerm is installed on Windows, and put back what reinstalling over an older version took out: installing a new version by hand first runs the old uninstaller, which removed the command and the folder menu; Settings now keeps each choice in tTerm's local data directory, and the installer starts tTerm with --add-system-integration, which adds the command unless the user turned it off and the folder menu if they turned it on; an update brings the command to those who never turned it on, and a folder menu turned on before the choice was kept is remembered when tTerm starts ([299de6e6](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/299de6e660de36f3756b186029a829154139d7d0))\n- let tterm run in tTerm's own local tabs on macOS without the command installed: the command needs a link in /usr/local/bin, which takes an administrator's password, so it cannot be added for the user; tTerm now writes the launcher at every start and adds its directory to the end of a local tab's PATH, after the user's own programs; the switch in Settings only adds or removes the link that other terminals need, and turning it off keeps the launcher the tabs use ([be041f19](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/be041f19327a623b604848bb5b4faefad2b33719))\n\n### Fixes\n\n- show the Windows folder menu as on only when all three of its verbs are there: only the folder's was checked, so a menu whose background or drive entry was missing, after a write failed partway or another program removed it, showed as on and was never put back; it now shows as off, and turning it on writes all three ([336ec25b](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/336ec25b9e2fc68c476e57d7c3f20aa75576574b))\n\n**Full comparison:** [v0.7.2-beta.5...v0.7.2-beta.6](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/compare/v0.7.2-beta.5...v0.7.2-beta.6)",
